        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T11:42:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should this use `SYS_INIT`?  `HOOK_INIT` runs pretty late and will eventually be deprecated.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 453,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 453,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "5ab3e7ef06b245e7eecb5814622b28af33629e74",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "af3adfea_3163013b",
        "filename": "zephyr/shim/src/panic.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 453,
      "author": {
        "id": 1390635
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T18:04:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The host event transport may not be connected at SYS_INIT, however the event should be queued and retried every second until it succeeds (see force_mkbp_if_events). This needs to be tested and verified.",
      "parentUuid": "7a3c1202_b6dd7ae0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 453,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 453,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "5ab3e7ef06b245e7eecb5814622b28af33629e74",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57e5919c_19d9e746",
        "filename": "zephyr/shim/src/panic.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 453,
      "author": {
        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T18:28:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t use SYS_INIT here as it\u0027s too early because host_set_single_event() triggers the MKBP subsystem, which relies on mutex locks and hook_call_deferred() for retry if the host transport is not yet connected",
      "parentUuid": "af3adfea_3163013b",
